WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.276
Rosters ready? Tap "Coin toss".

2
00:00:02.326 --> 00:00:04.930
Put each team on its side: "Switch sides".

3
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:09.545
The ball marks the first serve: "Switch serve" moves it.

4
00:00:09.595 --> 00:00:15.258
Coach and captain of each team sign: "Sign A" → "Coach".

5
00:00:15.308 --> 00:00:18.693
Sign, then "Save".

6
00:00:18.743 --> 00:00:24.360
Then the captain.

7
00:00:24.410 --> 00:00:29.403
Then "Confirm coin toss result". Missing signatures can follow during the warm-up.

8
00:00:29.453 --> 00:00:31.509
The starting line-ups: tap "Lineup A".

9
00:00:31.559 --> 00:00:38.559
Tap the players in order, position I (the server) first, then "Confirm".

10
00:00:41.953 --> 00:00:45.534
The captain is not on court: tap the "Game captain".

11
00:00:45.584 --> 00:00:52.584
The same for team B.

12
00:00:56.235 --> 00:00:57.977
Tap "Start set".

13
00:00:58.027 --> 00:01:01.610
A reminder: put the libero in if the team has one.

14
00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.747
Confirm the start time of the set.

15
00:01:04.797 --> 00:01:07.879
Set 1 is running.
